OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 31 MAY
OL,4,G1700FThe Early Music Show
OL,5,     GHannah French traces the life and
OL,6,     Gcareer of the Elizabethan
OL,7,     Gcomposer and organist Thomas
OL,8,     GWeelkes, who was born 450 years
OL,9,     Gago this year.
OL,10,G1800FChoral Evensong
OL,11,     GLive from St Davids Cathedral,
OL,12,     Gwith music by Tomkins and Tallis.
OL,13,G1900FSunday Feature: The Messy Guide
OL,14,     Fto AI
OL,15,     GComposer Jennifer Walshe explores
OL,16,     Gthe philosophical and aesthetic
OL,17,     Gquestions that AI raises for how
OL,18,     Gwe make, listen to and think
OL,19,     Gabout music.
